"這是目前裝置與受信任電腦之間的敏感信任憑證。RouteLocation 使用它建立裝置服務連線；它不是 IPA 簽名檔，也不會上傳。" = "This sensitive credential records trust between this device and a computer. RouteLocation uses it to open device-service connections. It is not an IPA signing file and is never uploaded.";
"透過 LocalDevVPN 建立的本機通道，讓 RouteLocation 能連接這台裝置。它與一般網際網路連線是不同狀態。" = "A local tunnel created through LocalDevVPN lets RouteLocation reach this device. It is separate from normal Internet connectivity.";
"DDI 提供 Apple 開發者裝置服務。位置模擬前必須準備並掛載；首次下載需要網際網路。" = "The DDI provides Apple's developer device services. It must be prepared and mounted before simulation; the first download requires Internet access.";
"顯示目前是否正在傳送單點或路線位置。按下「恢復真實位置」可停止模擬並清除開發者位置。" = "Shows whether a single location or route is being sent. Return to Real Location stops simulation and clears the developer location.";
"DVT 是實際傳送開發者位置指令的工作階段。若中斷，路線會保留經過時間並進行有限次重新連線。" = "DVT is the session that sends developer-location commands. If it drops, playback preserves elapsed time and makes bounded reconnect attempts.";
"顯示目前使用 Wi-Fi、行動網路或離線。已快取的路線播放不需要網際網路。" = "Shows Wi-Fi, cellular, or offline status. Cached route playback does not require Internet access.";
"Apple 地圖搜尋、新導航路線計算與首次 DDI 下載需要網際網路；直線及已儲存路線不需要。" = "Apple Maps search, new navigation calculations, and the first DDI download require Internet access. Straight and saved routes do not.";
"顯示系統是否偵測到 VPN 介面。這只能作為提示，不等同於 DVT 工作階段已成功連線。" = "Shows whether iOS detects a VPN interface. This is only a hint and does not mean the DVT session is connected.";
"配對檔案是敏感的裝置信任憑證。請妥善保管；RouteLocation 只會儲存在本機，絕不會上傳內容。" = "A pairing file is a sensitive device-trust credential. Keep it private; RouteLocation stores it locally and never uploads its contents.";
"如果 iLoader 的「Manage Pairing File」沒有列出 RouteLocation，請在 iLoader 選擇 Export，將這台 iPhone 或 iPad 的配對檔案傳到裝置，再按下方按鈕手動匯入。" = "If iLoader's Manage Pairing File screen does not list RouteLocation, choose Export in iLoader, transfer this iPhone or iPad's pairing file to the device, then import it manually below.";
"請啟動 LocalDevVPN，設定期間保持裝置喚醒及解鎖，並確認配對檔案屬於目前這台 iPhone 或 iPad。" = "Start LocalDevVPN, keep the device awake and unlocked during setup, and confirm that the pairing file belongs to this iPhone or iPad.";
"背景執行受 iOS 系統限制。強制結束 RouteLocation、重新啟動裝置、iOS 終止程序或系統層級錯誤都會停止播放。" = "Background execution is best-effort. Force-quitting RouteLocation, rebooting, iOS process termination, or a system-level failure stops playback.";
"沒有帳號、分析、遙測、後端、CloudKit 或路線上傳。只有在你要求 MapKit 圖磚、搜尋及導航計算時才會連接 Apple 服務。" = "There are no accounts, analytics, telemetry, backend, CloudKit, or route uploads. Apple services are contacted only for requested MapKit tiles, searches, and navigation calculations.";
"已允許永遠取用位置。只有在播放期間才會啟用靜音音訊、低精確度定位與背景工作保活。" = "Always location access is enabled. Silent audio, low-accuracy location, and background-task keep-alives run only during playback.";
"若要提高背景播放持續運作的機會，請將位置權限設為「永遠」。" = "Set Location access to Always for the strongest best-effort background playback.";
"無法使用背景定位；切換到其他 App 後，播放可能會被暫停。" = "Background location access is unavailable; playback may be suspended after switching apps.";
"開始播放時會要求背景運作所需的位置權限。" = "Starting playback requests the location access needed for best-effort background operation.";
"請在 iOS「設定」檢查位置權限。" = "Check Location access in iOS Settings.";

